    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tek0](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tek0) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Sep 05 2026 33km S of Ibau. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -19.807 longitude 170.1576. It impacted 564 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
